        "app_name": "Clone Drone in the Hyperdome",
        "release_date": "1980-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
        "description": "**Sword fight with killer robots in VR! \nWatch as limbs fly off from a single cut of your energy blade!**\n\nYou are Blink, a teleporting robot who is the newest “looprunner” gladiator to compete in the Crashloop, a deadly roguelike tournament to the death. \n\n{1727001051424708}\n\nDie and reawaken in an endless loop, leap over lava pools, avoid turret fire, and take down waves of enemy defendroids.\n\n{959485716008990}\n\n**Battle your fellow looprunners for a chance to fight the Captain in the Hyperdome.** In between runs, get to know the other looprunners and learn the secrets of Crashloop. Take sides in their rivalries. Let your sword do the talking to win their favor.\n\n{928290205858321}\n\n**Defeat other looprunners to claim their Turbofists!** Shoot flames, launch shurikens, slow time, summon zombies and more! Upgrade the turbofists with power from other defeated looprunners to become unstoppable.\n\n{918925916239161}\n\n**Swing lots of different weapons to find your favorite style.** Two handed spears, a katana, an axe and shield? If you’re daring, fight with your bare metal fists!\n\n{893046812999213}\n\n**Feel the power of voxel destruction. Learn to wield your laser sword.** \n\n**The Hyperdome awaits!**\n\n\n{1487308608642669}",
